<title>USA: Textron, AT&amp;T sign $1.1 bln contract.</title>
<headline>Textron, AT&amp;T sign $1.1 bln contract.</headline>
<dateline>FLORHAM PARK, N.J. 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Textron Inc and AT&amp;T Corp said Tuesday they have signed a $1.1 billion, 10-year contract for AT&amp;T to handle Textron's worldwide communications system.</p>
<p>The companies said the contract should save Textron $125 million over 10 years by centralizing Textron's communications infrastructure.</p>
<p>The contract calls for AT&amp;T to upgrade, expand and manage Textron's communications network, the companies said.</p>
</text>
